  m_Name: lore_l4_wall
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: RootAccess.Systems::RootAccess.Systems.LoreDefinition
  loreId: lore_l4_wall
  title: "Inscrip\u021Bie pe zid"
  body: "Am fost ingineri la Halden. Acum dormim l\xE2ng\u0103 conducte. Ei au scos
    oamenii din ora\u0219 \u0219i au p\u0103strat doar datele lor. Dac\u0103 treci
    pe aici, las\u0103 o lantern\u0103. \u0218i \xEEnchide stavila \xEEn urma ta."
  titleEn: Writing on the wall
  bodyEn: We were engineers at Halden. Now we sleep next to the pipes. They pushed
    the people out of the city and kept only their data. If you pass through, leave
    a torch. And close the sluice behind you.
  levelId: level04
  order: 11
